{"articleNo":"199502","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=199502&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"「2018 도시재생 한마당-도시재생 미래를 잡(Job)다」 행사 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.10.15","hit":"6226","attachments":[{"name":"2018 도시재생한마당 웹포스터.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=199502&attachNo=79514"},{"name":"도시재생 일자리 한마당 추진계획(2018 도시재생 한마당).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=199502&attachNo=79541"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">‘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">도시재생 미래를 잡</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">(Job)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">!’ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">라는 주제로 다채롭게 마련된 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">2018 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">도시재생 한마당</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">은도시재생사업을 홍보하고 우수사례와 성과를 공유하며 도시재생으로 미래를 열어가기 위한 행사입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">위와 관련하여 도시재생과 관련된 일자리를 소개하고 취업상담 및 구직을 위한 컨설팅</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">이미지 메이킹 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">행사도 마련되어 있으니 지역학생들의 많은 참여바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><str